---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import ProcessSteps from "../components/ProcessSteps.astro";
import FAQAccordion from "../components/FAQAccordion.astro";
import CTAForm from "../components/CTAForm.astro";
import aboutPortrait from "../assets/Image_20260509161325_9_79.jpg";
import whatIDoImage from "../assets/WhatsApp Image 2025-03-13 at 2.32.28 PM(6).jpeg";
---

<Layout
	pageTitle="After Dark Studio | Hong Kong Rental Interiors"
	pageDescription="After Dark Studio helps renters in Hong Kong turn temporary spaces into homes that work for real life."
	headerTheme="dark"
>
	<Hero />

	<Section id="is-this-you">
		<div class="is-you-strip__inner">
			<div class="is-you-strip__heading-wrap">
				<h2 class="is-you-strip__heading">Is This You?</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="is-you-strip__content">
				<div class="is-you-strip__grid">
					<ul>
						<li>Your dining table is mostly a drop-zone, not for eating</li>
						<li>One chair has become the permanent clothes mountain</li>
						<li>You've done the “shove everything in one room and close the door” before guests arrive</li>
					</ul>
					<ul>
						<li>You don't want to throw everything out and start over</li>
						<li>You're about to move and want the new place to feel right from day one</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<p class="is-you-strip__closing">If you're mentally ticking a few boxes, you're exactly who I design for.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section id="what-i-do">
		<div class="what-i-do__inner">
			<h2 class="what-i-do__heading">How I Actually Help</h2>
			<div class="what-i-do__container">
				<div class="what-i-do__copy card">
					<h3>Not a "buy everything new" service</h3>
					<p>Most design services start with shopping lists. I start with what you already have.</p>

					<p>Together we will:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Re-plan your layout and systems so your home fits how you really live</li>
						<li>Rearrange and edit what you already own so it works harder for you</li>
						<li>Only add new pieces if they clearly solve a problem (light, storage, comfort) and can move with you</li>
					</ul>
					<p>If you're looking for a shopping buddy to replace everything from scratch, I'm not the right fit. If you'd rather make the most of what you already own, I am.</p>
				</div>
				<figure class="what-i-do__image">
					<img src={whatIDoImage.src} alt="What I actually do - interior design process" />
				</figure>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<ProcessSteps />

	<Section id="investment" title="Investment">
		<div class="investment__container">
			<p>I work with renters in two focused sessions to fix the repeat problems in your home, the chair that always collects clothes, the table that disappears under piles, the corner you never use. Most clients choose to work on their whole flat, but you can also start with a single room.</p>

			<div class="investment__offers">
				<div class="offer-card">
					<h4>My Whole Flat Feels Off</h4>
					<p>You're not using half your space, every surface seems to collect stuff, and no room really feels "finished". You want the entire flat to feel calmer and more functional.</p>
					<p><strong>Typical investment: around HKD 5,000</strong></p>
				</div>
				<div class="offer-card">
					<h4>One Room Is Driving Me Mad</h4>
					<p>Maybe it's the living room that never feels tidy, or the bedroom that doesn't feel restful. You want to get one room right first and use that as a template for the rest.</p>
					<p><strong>Typical investment: around HKD 3,200</strong></p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<p>Not sure which option fits? On our free 15-minute Home Fit Call, I'll recommend the right scope for your space and give you a clear quote before you decide.</p>

			<p class="pricing-cta"><a class="button button--primary" href="#ready" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Start with a free 15-minute Home Fit Call</a></p>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section id="about" title="About">
		<div class="about-section__inner">
			<div class="about-section__copy card">
				<h3>I'm Drishti, a spatial designer based in Hong Kong</h3>
				<p>With a background in interior and scenic design for theatre, sets and installations, my specialty has always been <strong>spatial planning</strong>, finding the exact placement of a bed, table or light that makes your body relax because the space finally works with you, not against you.</p>
				<p>I've designed everything from 7,500 sq ft penthouses to tiny rentals and theatre sets, and I bring that same level of care to your one-year rental so it feels designed specifically for you, not just “good enough for now”.</p>
				<p><a class="about-section__link" href="http://drishtichauhandesign.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See more of my design work here?</a></p>
			</div>

			<figure class="about-section__portrait">
				<img src={aboutPortrait.src} alt="Portrait of Drishti" />
			</figure>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<FAQAccordion />

	<Section id="ready" title="Ready For A Space That Fits How You Really Live?">
		<div class="card contact-cta">
			<CTAForm />
		</div>
	</Section>

</Layout>

<style>
	#is-this-you {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
		--section-border: rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.2);
	}

	#what-i-do {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-teal);
		--section-border: rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.08);
	}

	.is-you-strip {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
		padding: 2.5rem 0;
	}

	.is-you-strip__inner {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.is-you-strip__heading-wrap {
		padding-left: 1rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip__content {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip__heading {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid {
		border-left: 3px solid var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		padding-left: 1rem;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem 2rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid ul {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 1rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid li {
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid li::marker {
		color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-1));
	}

	.is-you-strip__closing {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__inner {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__heading {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 68ch;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
		text-align: left;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.95fr) minmax(340px, 0.8fr);
		column-gap: 4rem;
		align-items: stretch;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	@media (min-width: 861px) {
		.section#what-i-do .section__inner {
			max-width: min(100%, 78rem);
			padding: 0 2rem;
		}

		.section#investment .section__inner {
			max-width: 100%;
			padding: 0 2rem;
		}

		.investment__container {
			max-width: 65%;
			margin-left: auto;
			margin-right: auto;
		}
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__copy {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 44rem;
		align-self: stretch;
		justify-self: stretch;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__copy h3 {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__image {
		margin: 0;
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		overflow: hidden;
		justify-self: end;
		width: 100%;
		align-self: stretch;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		display: block;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		#what-i-do .what-i-do__container {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}

		#what-i-do .what-i-do__copy {
			padding: 1.25rem;
		}

		.is-you-strip__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.about-section__inner,
		.investment__offers {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	#investment .card {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.35));
		box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.06);
	}

	#investment p,
	#investment li {
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	#investment .button--primary {
		background: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		color: var(--section-accent-text, var(--bg));
	}

	.about-section {
		background: var(--bg);
		padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.about-section__inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(260px, 0.85fr);
		gap: 1.25rem;
		align-items: stretch;
	}

	.about-section__copy {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.28));
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.about-section__copy p {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.about-section__link {
		display: inline-flex;
		margin-top: 1.15rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--section-accent-link, var(--accent-teal));
	}

	.about-section__link:hover,
	.about-section__link:focus-visible {
		color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		outline: none;
	}

	.about-section__portrait {
		margin: 0;
		display: grid;
	}

	.about-section__portrait img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		min-height: 340px;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center;
		border-radius: 18px;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.16);
	}

	.investment__container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: 2rem;
		align-items: center;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.investment__offers {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.offer-card {
		background: #1e293b;
		border: 1px solid #1e293b;
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
		backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
	}

	.offer-card h4 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #f5f0e8;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
	}

	.offer-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #f5f0e8;
	}

	.offer-card strong {
		color: #c7945c;
	}
</style>
